AltoStaking::advanceEpoch()
├── given contract is in pause mode
│   └── it should revert
├── given contract is in rescue mode
│   └── it should revert
└── given contract is not paused or in rescue mode
    ├── when limit is zero and current epoch not finished
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when limit is zero after time advance
    │   └── it should advance all available epochs
    ├── when limit is greater than epochs to advance
    │   └── it should advance all available epochs
    ├── when limit equals epochs to advance
    │   └── it should advance exact number of epochs
    └── when limit is less than epochs to advance
        └── it should advance partial epochs up to limit

